{"type":"message","id":"0e2e23b7","parentId":"ed9af53a","timestamp":"2026-03-15T00:58:51.411Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"792643266","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat Check (Every 5 Minutes)\n\nRun high-frequency system health and project synchronization checks.\n\n## 1. System Health 🏥\n- Verify Gateway is responsive on port 18789.\n- Check LM Studio health at `http://100.67.202.80:3003/v1`.\n- Review last 50 lines of logs for errors (`openclaw logs --limit 50`). If errors found, document in `LESSONS.md` and alert user on Telegram.\n\n## 2. Project Synchronization (D:\\AI_PROJECTS\\projects) 🔄\n- Scan `D:\\AI_PROJECTS\\projects` for uncommitted changes.\n- For each repo with changes:\n    - Stage all (`git add .`)\n    - Commit with `auto-sync: heartbeat update`\n    - Push to remote\n- If any project is a \"GitHub Pages\" site (check for `.github/workflows` or certain keywords), ensure the push triggers the deployment.\n\n## 3. Recursive Learning 🧠\n- If you've solved a problem since the last heartbeat, update `LESSONS.md`.\n- Read `LESSONS.md` to ensure your current session follows all rules.\n\n## Delivery 📲\n- Report issues to Telegram ONLY if redundant or urgent.\n- Silence (`HEARTBEAT_OK`) is preferred if all systems are nominal.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773536331410}}
